        "quote": "(a) Notwithstanding TMC 1.10.070 , punishment for a violation of TMC 9.25.030 shall be as follows:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
