          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 159,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:1",
          "start": 99
        },
        "quote": "(1) Upon a first conviction, a fine of not more than $1,000.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.050 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "488512c1-84bb-5d54-afd6-68f170d9ddd8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 243,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:2",
          "start": 160
        },
        "quote": "(2) Upon a second conviction, a fine of not less than $100.00 nor more than $1,000.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.050 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "8161aef8-4e7a-511b-9d24-e59ab3fd57f0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 326,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:3",
          "start": 244
        },
        "quote": "(3) Upon a third conviction, a fine of not less than $500.00 nor more than $1,000.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.050 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "321c19dd-f21d-5620-a218-57a9a0f0b0d0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 423,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:4",
          "start": 327
        },
        "quote": "(4) Upon a fourth or subsequent conviction, a fine of not less than $1,000 nor more than $2,500.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.050 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "d6501894-5152-5ebd-bdd0-18a59df6b7f5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 586,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:5",
          "start": 424
        },
        "quote": "In addition to the preceding fines such person may be punished by a term of imprisonment which shall not exceed 12 months, or by both such fines and imprisonment.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.050 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "3082a618-06cc-502b-947a-ba69e531524e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 713,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:6",
          "start": 587
        },
        "quote": "(b) For the purposes of determining whether a conviction is a first or subsequent conviction in sentencing under this section:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.050 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "3b4ea316-a556-5d0d-8e14-224ba1638408",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 884,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:7",
          "start": 714
        },
        "quote": "(1) Conviction includes being convicted of a violation of TMC 9.25.030 and it is irrelevant whether an offense occurred before or after conviction for a previous offense.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.050 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "6a006ce8-a621-54d2-b5bc-793996ed2665",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1087,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:8",
          "start": 885
        },
        "quote": "(2) Conviction includes being convicted of a violation of TMC 9.25.030 or entering into a diversion agreement in lieu of further criminal proceedings on a complaint alleging a violation of this chapter.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.050 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "acd83377-fdfc-52dc-a320-0498ee9c8dc6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1249,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:9",
          "start": 1088
        },
        "quote": "(3) Any convictions occurring during the three years prior to the date of the occurrence shall be taken into account when determining the sentence to be imposed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.25.050 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "c606d203-c3a7-507c-afa9-774e8c8bc1c3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1427,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.25.050:block:10",
          "start": 1250
        },
        "quote": "(c) Each day that any violation of this chapter continues shall constitute a separate offense and may be punishable hereunder as a separate violation. (Ord. 20439 § 4, 7-11-23.)",
